  "name": "Coconut Chicken Curry",
  "subtitle": "A hearty curry with chicken, sweet potato, plantain, and greens",
  "description": "Chicken and vegetables simmer in coconut milk and crushed tomatoes with warm curry seasoning for a substantial one-pot meal.",
